# Direct backend dependencies (source of truth).
#
# requirements.txt is COMPILED from this file and contains fully pinned
# transitive dependencies. Never edit requirements.txt by hand.
#
# Regenerate after changing this file:
#   .venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
#   pip-compile requirements.in --output-file requirements.txt
#   pip-sync requirements.txt          # optional: match env exactly
#   pip-audit                          # required: audit before committing
#
# Upper bounds are set at the next major version so a compile picks up patch
# and minor security fixes, while a breaking major bump is a deliberate,
# reviewed change (SUPPLY-001).

